<title>USA: Bosch says forms U.S. engineering tools unit.</title>
<headline>Bosch says forms U.S. engineering tools unit.</headline>
<dateline>BROADVIEW, Ill. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Bosch Corp, the U.S. unit of Robert Bosch GmbH  said established ETAS Inc, a newly formed North American unit located in Ann Arbor, Mich.</p>
<p>ETAS will supply engineering tools and application services for automotive embedded control systems, such as engine control modules and antilock brake system controllers, based on hardware and software products developed by ETAS GmbH, located near Stuttgart, Germany, Bosch said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
